{
  "title": "四边形翻折与二面角问题",
  "problem_html": "如图，在四边形$ABCD$中，<span class='t' data-el='ln_AB'>$AB \\parallel CD$</span>，<span class='t' data-el='angle_DAB'>$\\angle DAB=90^{\\circ}$</span>，$F$为$CD$的中点，点$E$在$AB$上，<span class='t' data-el='ln_EF'>$EF \\parallel AD$</span>，<span class='t' data-el='ln_AB'>$AB=3AD$</span>，<span class='t' data-el='ln_CD'>$CD=2AD$</span>，将四边形$EFDA$沿$EF$翻折至四边形$EFD'A'$，使得面$EFD'A'$与面$EFCB$所成的二面角为$60^{\\circ}$。",
  "questions": [
    {
      "label": "(1)",
      "html": "证明：<span class='t' data-el='ln_A_B'>$A'B \\parallel$</span>平面<span class='t' data-el='pl_CD_F'>$CD'F$</span>"
    },
    {
      "label": "(2)",
      "html": "求面<span class='t' data-el='pl_BCD'>$BCD'$</span>与面<span class='t' data-el='pl_EFD_A'>$EFD'A'$</span>所成的二面角的正弦值"
    }
  ],
