  "solution_script": [
    {
      "phase": "审题",
      "speech": "同学们，我们来看这道立体几何翻折问题。题目给出了一个四边形，里面有平行关系和垂直关系。",
      "els": [
        "ln_EF",
        "ln_EB",
        "ln_FC",
        "ln_BC"
      ],
      "cam": [
        1.2,
        -0.5,
        12,
        2000
      ],
      "math": [
        {
          "type": "desc",
          "v": "已知条件梳理"
        },
        {
          "type": "tex",
          "v": "AB \\parallel CD, \\angle DAB=90^{\\circ}"
        }
      ],
      "clear": false
    },
    {
      "phase": "审题",
      "speech": "关键条件是 EF 平行于 AD，AB 等于三倍 AD，CD 等于两倍 AD。F 是 CD 的中点。",
      "els": [
        "ln_EF",
        "pl_EFCB"
      ],
      "cam": [
        1.1,
        -0.6,
        13,
        2000
      ],
      "math": [
        {
          "type": "tex",
          "v": "AB=3AD, CD=2AD"
        },
        {
          "type": "tex",
          "v": "EF \\parallel AD"
        }
      ],
      "clear": false
    },
    {
      "phase": "审题",
      "speech": "最重要的是翻折操作：把四边形 EFDA 沿着 EF 翻折，形成一个新的空间图形，二面角是六十度。",
      "els": [
        "ln_EA_prime",
        "ln_A_prime_D_prime",
        "ln_D_prime_F",
        "pl_EFD_A"
      ],
      "cam": [
        1.0,
        -0.4,
        11,
        2000
      ],
      "math": [
        {
          "type": "desc",
          "v": "翻折后形成空间图形"
        },
        {
          "type": "tex",
          "v": "\\text{二面角}=60^{\\circ}"
        }
      ],
      "clear": false
    },
    {
      "phase": "审题",
      "speech": "第一问要证明 A'B 平行于平面 CD'F，第二问求两个平面所成二面角的正弦值。",
      "els": [
        "ln_A_B",
        "pl_CD_F",
        "pl_BCD"
      ],
      "cam": [
        1.0,
        -0.5,
        12,
        2000
      ],
      "math": [
        {
          "type": "desc",
          "v": "求证与求解目标"
        },
        {
          "type": "tex",
          "v": "(1)\\ A'B \\parallel \\text{平面}CD'F"
        }
      ],
      "clear": false
    },
    {
      "phase": "建立坐标系",
      "speech": "现在我们来建立空间直角坐标系。设 AD 等于一，这样可以简化计算。",
      "els": [
        "coord_axes"
      ],
      "cam": [
        0.8,
        -0.3,
        10,
        2000
      ],
      "math": [
        {
          "type": "desc",
          "v": "设 AD=1"
        },
        {
          "type": "tex",
          "v": "AB=3, CD=2, EF=1"
        }
      ],
      "clear": false
    },
    {
      "phase": "建立坐标系",
      "speech": "以 E 为原点，EB 方向为 x 轴，EF 方向为 y 轴，建立坐标系。这样各点坐标就很清晰了。",
      "els": [
        "coord_labels"
      ],
      "cam": [
        0.7,
        -0.2,
        9,
        2000
      ],
      "math": [
        {
          "type": "desc",
          "v": "各点坐标"
        },
        {
          "type": "tex",
          "v": "E(0,0,0), F(0,1,0), B(2,0,0)"
        }
      ],
      "clear": false
    },
    {
      "phase": "第 (1) 题",
      "speech": "第一问要证明线面平行。我们先写出翻折后 A'和 D'的坐标，它们绕 EF 轴旋转了六十度。",
      "els": [
        "ln_EA_prime",
        "ln_A_prime_D_prime"
      ],
      "cam": [
        0.9,
        -0.4,
        11,
        2000
      ],
      "math": [
        {
          "type": "tex",
          "v": "A'(-\\frac{1}{2},0,\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2})"
        },
        {
          "type": "tex",
          "v": "D'(-\\frac{1}{2},1,\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2})"
        }
      ],
      "clear": false
    },
    {
      "phase": "第 (1) 题",
      "speech": "接下来求向量 A'B。用 B 点坐标减去 A'点坐标，得到这个向量的三个分量。",
      "els": [
        "ln_A_B",
        "vec_A_B"
      ],
      "cam": [
        1.0,
        -0.5,
        12,
        2000
      ],
      "math": [
        {
          "type": "desc",
          "v": "计算向量 A'B"
        },
        {
          "type": "tex",
          "v": "\\overrightarrow{A'B}=(\\frac{5}{2},0,-\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2})"
        }
      ],
      "clear": false
    },
    {
      "phase": "第 (1) 题",
      "speech": "现在求平面 CD'F 的法向量。我们取平面内的两个向量 FD'和 FC。",
      "els": [
        "pl_CD_F",
        "vec_FD_prime",
        "vec_FC"
      ],
      "cam": [
        1.1,
        -0.6,
        13,
        2000
      ],
      "math": [
        {
          "type": "tex",
          "v": "\\overrightarrow{FD'}=(-\\frac{1}{2},0,\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2})"
        },
        {
          "type": "tex",
          "v": "\\overrightarrow{FC}=(1,0,0)"
        }
      ],
      "clear": false
    },
    {
      "phase": "第 (1) 题",
      "speech": "用叉乘求法向量。这两个向量的叉乘结果就是平面的法向量方向。",
      "els": [
        "nrm_CD_F"
      ],
      "cam": [
        1.0,
        -0.5,
        12,
        2000
      ],
      "math": [
        {
          "type": "desc",
          "v": "平面 CD'F 的法向量"
        },
        {
          "type": "tex",
          "v": "\\vec{n_1}=\\overrightarrow{FD'}\\times\\overrightarrow{FC}=(0,1,0)"
        }
      ],
      "clear": false
    },
    {
      "phase": "第 (1) 题",
      "speech": "验证线面平行的条件：向量 A'B 与法向量垂直，也就是它们的点积等于零。",
      "els": [
        "ln_A_B",
        "nrm_CD_F"
      ],
      "cam": [
        0.9,
        -0.4,
        11,
        2000
      ],
      "math": [
        {
          "type": "tex",
          "v": "\\overrightarrow{A'B}\\cdot\\vec{n_1}=0"
        },
        {
          "type": "desc",
          "v": "A'B 垂直于法向量"
        }
      ],
      "clear": false
    },
    {
      "phase": "第 (1) 题",
      "speech": "最后确认 A'点不在平面 CD'F 上。A'的 y 坐标是零，而平面上三点的 y 坐标都是一。",
      "els": [
        "pl_CD_F",
        "ln_A_B"
      ],
      "cam": [
        1.0,
        -0.5,
        12,
        2000
      ],
      "math": [
        {
          "type": "desc",
          "v": "A'不在平面 CD'F 上"
        },
        {
          "type": "tex",
          "v": "A'_y=0, \\text{平面}CD'F:y=1"
        }
      ],
      "clear": false
    },
    {
      "phase": "第 (1) 题",
      "speech": "综上，A'B 平行于平面 CD'F。第一问得证。",
      "els": [
        "ln_A_B",
        "pl_CD_F"
      ],
      "cam": [
        1.1,
        -0.6,
        13,
        2000
      ],
      "math": [
        {
          "type": "desc",
          "v": "结论"
        },
        {
          "type": "tex",
          "v": "\\therefore A'B \\parallel \\text{平面}CD'F"
        }
      ],
      "clear": false
    },
    {
      "phase": "第 (2) 题",
      "speech": "第二问求二面角。先求平面 EFD'A'的法向量，取平面内的向量 EF 和 EA'。",
      "els": [
        "pl_EFD_A",
        "nrm_EFD_A"
      ],
      "cam": [
        0.8,
        -0.3,
        10,
        2000
      ],
      "math": [
        {
          "type": "tex",
          "v": "\\overrightarrow{EF}=(0,1,0)"
        },
        {
          "type": "tex",
          "v": "\\overrightarrow{EA'}=(-\\frac{1}{2},0,\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2})"
        }
      ],
      "clear": false
    },
    {
      "phase": "第 (2) 题",
      "speech": "计算叉乘得到法向量 n 二。这个向量垂直于平面 EFD'A'。",
      "els": [
        "nrm_EFD_A"
      ],
      "cam": [
        0.9,
        -0.4,
        11,
        2000
      ],
      "math": [
        {
          "type": "desc",
          "v": "平面 EFD'A'的法向量"
        },
        {
          "type": "tex",
          "v": "\\vec{n_2}=(\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2},0,\\frac{1}{2})"
        }
      ],
      "clear": false
    },
    {
